{"unit":4,"items":30,"pass":21,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 4","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 4 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>Changes and challenges</h2>\n      <p data-t=\"gx255\">Thirty questions on Unit 4 only. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>21 out of 30</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u4\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u4r101\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;14</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u4r102\">Choose the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">She has given up&hellip; her email at the weekend.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">checking</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">to check</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">check</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">They decided&hellip; the party until August.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">putting off</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">to put off</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">put off</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">He is not very good at&hellip; his own plans.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">arranging</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">to arrange</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">I promised&hellip; her back before six.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">calling</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">to call</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">call</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u4r103\">Put the verb in brackets into the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>work</i>) She avoided <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"working\" data-why=\"<b>Avoid</b> takes the <i>-ing</i> form.\"> at weekends for a whole year.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>retire</i>) He is planning <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"to retire\" data-why=\"<b>Plan</b> takes <i>to</i>.\"> in his early sixties.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>change</i>) Instead of <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"changing\" data-why=\"After a preposition, always <i>-ing</i>.\"> career, she took up the piano.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u4r104\">Intention or arrangement? Choose the more natural form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">The table is booked. We&hellip; at eight.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">are going to eat</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">are eating</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">eat</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">Nothing is fixed yet, but one day I&hellip; a new language.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">am going to learn</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">am learning</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">Look at that sky. It&hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is going to rain</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">is raining tomorrow</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u4r105\">Each sentence has one wrong word. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"3\" data-why=\"After <b>going to</b> the verb is plain: <i>going to walk</i>.\"><span class=\"ew\">I&rsquo;m</span> <span class=\"ew\">going</span> <span class=\"ew\">to</span> <span class=\"ew\">walking</span> <span class=\"ew\">to</span> <span class=\"ew\">work</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"2\" data-why=\"The Present Simple is not a future form here: <i>I&rsquo;m meeting a friend tomorrow</i>.\"><span class=\"ew\">I</span> <span class=\"ew\">meet</span> <span class=\"ew\">a</span> <span class=\"ew\">friend</span> <span class=\"ew\">tomorrow</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u4r106\">Write the sentence again so that it means the same.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">My plan is to spend a day offline.<br>I <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"am going to spend a day offline|'m going to spend a day offline|am going to spend a day offline.\" data-why=\"An intention: <b>am going to spend</b>.\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">She has decided not to check work email at home.<br>She <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"isn't going to check work email at home|is not going to check work email at home|isn&rsquo;t going to check work email at home\" data-why=\"Negative intention: <b>isn&rsquo;t going to check</b>.\"></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u4r107\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 15&ndash;24</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u4r108\">Complete each sentence with one word or phrase.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">He <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"took up\" data-why=\"<b>Take up</b> = start a new hobby or activity.\"> the guitar when he was fifteen.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">She <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"retired\" data-why=\"<b>Retire</b> = stop working, usually because of your age.\"> at sixty-one and immediately got bored.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">I never completely <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"switch off\" data-why=\"<b>Switch off</b> = stop working and stop thinking about work.\"> and stop thinking about work.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">It is much easier to <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"get in touch\" data-why=\"<b>Get in touch</b> = contact somebody after a while.\"> with old friends these days.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">Shall I <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"book a table\" data-why=\"<b>Book a table</b> = reserve a place in a restaurant.\"> for eight o&rsquo;clock?</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u4r109\">Choose the correct word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">Sorry, I&hellip; &mdash; I was on the train.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">put off your call</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">confirmed your call</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">missed your call</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">I&rsquo;ll email you nearer the time to&hellip; the details.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">suggest</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">confirm</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">invite</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">22</span><span class=\"body\">Most of the students on the course were&hellip; , not twenty.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">middle-aged</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">teenagers</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">conductors</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u4r110\">One word in each group does not belong. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">23</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others move a plan forward. <b>Put off</b> moves it back.\"><span class=\"ew\">arrange</span> <span class=\"ew\">confirm</span> <span class=\"ew\">fix</span> <span class=\"ew\">put off</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">24</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others are things you do online. <b>Get home</b> happens in the street.\"><span class=\"ew\">log on</span> <span class=\"ew\">download</span> <span class=\"ew\">shop online</span> <span class=\"ew\">get home</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u4r111\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 3 &middot; Function &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 25&ndash;30</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u4r112\">Choose the correct phrase.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">25</span><span class=\"body\">&hellip; doing something at the weekend?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Would you like</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Shall we</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Do you fancy</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">26</span><span class=\"body\">&hellip; meet for lunch on Thursday?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Would you like to</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Do you fancy</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">How about</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">27</span><span class=\"body\">The most polite way to say no is&hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">&ldquo;No, Thursday is bad.&rdquo;</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">&ldquo;I&rsquo;m afraid I can&rsquo;t make Thursday &mdash; I&rsquo;m working. Is Sunday any good?&rdquo;</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">&ldquo;I can&rsquo;t come.&rdquo;</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u4r113\">Complete the conversation.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">28</span><span class=\"body\"><b>A:</b> Are you <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"doing anything\" data-why=\"<b>Are you doing anything</b> on Friday? &mdash; asking about the diary.\"> on Friday night?</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">29</span><span class=\"body\"><b>B:</b> I&rsquo;m sorry, I can&rsquo;t <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"make\" data-why=\"<b>Make it</b> / <b>make Friday</b> = be able to come.\"> Friday. How about Saturday instead?</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u4r114\">Put the three parts of a polite refusal in the usual order.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">30</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"order\" data-order=\"r1,r2,r3\">\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r3\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Is Sunday any good for you?</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r1\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">I&rsquo;m really sorry, but I can&rsquo;t make it tomorrow</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r2\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">&mdash; I&rsquo;m working.</span></button>\n        </div>\n      </span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}